"},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n비투자율이 2400인 철심으로 구성된 환상철심의 길이가\n0.6m, 단면적은 10cm이다. 여기에 0.04\nm의 공극을 형성한 경우의 자기저항AT은 공극이\n\n없는 경우보다 몇 배가 되는가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 121         ② 131\n\n③ 141         ④ 151\n\n⑤ 161","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m15-q.webp","width":696,"height":794},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n권수가 600회, 자체 인덕턴스가 720mH인 솔레노이드에\n\n15A 의 전류를 흘릴 때, 솔레노이드 내부 자속은?\n\n\n① ×       ② × \n③ ×       ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m16-q.webp","width":678,"height":575},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":887}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 직류 발전기에서 양호한 정류를 얻기 위해서는 정류주\n\n 기는 ( ㉠   ), 리액턴스 전압은 ( ㉡   ), ( ㉢  )을\n\n 설치해야 한다.\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    길게      작게     보상권선\n\n ②    길게      크게      보극\n\n ③    짧게      크게      보극\n\n ④    짧게      작게     보상권선\n\n ⑤    짧게      작게      보극","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m17-q.webp","width":678,"height":742},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":995}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n파권 8극, 전기자 총 도체수가 400, 극당 자속이 0.5\n\n인 직류 분권 전동기의 토크가 480N⦁m일 때, 전기자\n\n전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m18-q.webp","width":678,"height":566},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n수차 발전기의 특성을 터빈 발전기와 비교한 다음의 내용\n\n에서 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 수차 발전기는 극수가 ( ㉠   ), 단락비가 ( ㉡   ),\n\n 회전속도가 ( ㉢   ).\n\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    적고      크고      빠르다\n\n ②    많고      크고      빠르다\n\n ③    많고      크고      느리다\n\n ④    많고      작고      느리다\n\n ⑤    적고      작고      느리다","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m19-q.webp","width":696,"height":649},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n다음의 페란티 현상 및 자기여자 현상을 방지하기 위한 방\n\n법을 설명한 내용에서 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n ⦁수전단에 동기조상기를 (  ㉠  )로 접속하고 부족\n\n  여자로 운전한다.\n\n ⦁수전단에 (  ㉡   )를 병렬로 접속하고 충전전압을\n\n     (  ㉢    ).\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    병렬     분로리액터    높인다\n\n ②    직렬     직렬리액터    낮춘다\n\n ③    병렬     직렬리액터    높인다\n\n ④    직렬     분로리액터    낮춘다\n\n ⑤    병렬     분로리액터    낮춘다","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m20-q.webp","width":696,"height":749},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n권수비가 인 단상 변압기 2차측의 정격단자 전압이\n\n250V, 전압변동률이 8일 때, 1차측 단자전압V은?\n\n\n① 31750        ② 33750\n\n③ 35750        ④ 37750\n\n⑤ 39750","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m21-q.webp","width":696,"height":485},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1607}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음 중 3상을 2상으로 변경하기 위해 사용하는 결선법에\n\n해당하는 것은?\n\n     ㉠ 메이어결선    ㉡ 포크결선\n\n     ㉢ 2중 △결선    ㉣ 스코트결선\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉠㉢\n\n③ ㉠㉣         ④ ㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m22-q.webp","width":678,"height":685},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":275}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n3상 유도전동기의 슬립이 12이고, 2차측의 한 상의\n\n전류가 20A, 2차 저항이 0.2Ω인 경우의 3상 출력\n\nW은?\n\n\n① 1680         ② 1710\n\n③ 1760         ④ 1810\n\n⑤ 1860","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m23-q.webp","width":678,"height":604},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":950}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n정격상태로 운전하고 있는 3상 유도 전동기의 1차측의 인\n\n가 주파수가 60Hz이고, 회전자 주파수가 9Hz일 때, 2\n\n차 동손이 975W였다. 이 전동기의 2차 출력W은?\n\n\n① 5225         ② 5525\n\n③ 5625         ④ 5725\n\n⑤ 5755","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m24-q.webp","width":678,"height":594},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":932}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P038-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n액체 유전체를 넣은 콘덴서의 정전용량이 4F이고,\n\n누설전류가 50mA일 때, 콘덴서에 가해지는 전압kV은?\n\n(단, 고유저항은 Ω⦁, 비유전율은 3이다.)\n\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.01 한국전력기술 (스카우트)","originalId":"2024h1-e17-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m25-q.webp","width":696,"height":684},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e17-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":965}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
